{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026h7fPqtvjnq1794496613.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>受黃仁勳辭職消息影響，輝達股價曾經下跌超過一成四，市值蒸發近六千億美元。</p><p></p><p>而出任輝達臨時行政總裁的克雷斯稱，公司的力量始終源於員工，她會和管理團隊一起，在黃仁勳過去33年打下的堅實基礎上，繼續前行，並鞏固輝達在人工智能領域的領先地位。</p><p></p><p>路透社報道，輝達將於下星期召開全體員工會議。</p><p></p><p>在黃仁勳辭職前，美國富商馬斯克在社交平台稱，願意聘用黃仁勳。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T16:24:26.790914+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T15:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T18:19:08.730117+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T16:17:40.741931+00:00","content_hash":"f174b3585720ecc63514e9ae7b440b5c54b07a38ebbf09bfb034ab1c5d396c26","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T16:24:26.790914+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}